    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.poster.avif?t=1729673795\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.webm?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/0191ab0dc8f1b4d3fdeebbbd0940cb03.mp4?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/c7df70406f2590df93bdd2709e3f5e40.avif?t=1729673795\" data-has-big width=800 height=207 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.poster.avif?t=1729673795\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.webm?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/b193901dcf30c2d5afe1ca6c64cd537f.mp4?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.poster.avif?t=1729673795\" width=600 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.webm?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/dca668b223513062cd19f275b9f48cee.mp4?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Action Game Focused on Melee Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dawn of Kemet</i> is a 2D action game with an ancient Egyptian theme. Immerse yourself in rhythmic melee combat, utilizing weapons like swords, shields, and lances, with more than five other cold weapons planned.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.poster.avif?t=1729673795\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.webm?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/64c2550ab4ba250c5295765ada13ee1f.mp4?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u2015\u2015\u2015Shield blocking, parrying, guarding, lance stepping, and more...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch weapons during battle, and each weapon comes with its own set of actions, allowing you to develop your own combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.poster.avif?t=1729673795\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.webm?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/1372f1a5960f035d11d450833126bde5.mp4?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Bosses with Unique Characteristics and Charms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2015\u2015\u2015The Executioner of the Underworld, the Dancer of Rest\u2026 Defeat the various gods with unique personalities and charms using your strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These ruthless bosses will challenge you with overwhelming power. Attack and accumulate damage to bring them into a groggy state for a more powerful strike. Depending on the boss, you may witness phase transitions, part destruction, and changes in appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/569685e29b222a2c05ab15319d3c6eef.avif?t=1729673795\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Boss Rush Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bosses here feature challenging difficulty levels. Avoid, counter, and dismantle their relentless patterns in your own style, and defeat the gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've streamlined the exploration process leading to each boss, offering a boss rush format with consecutive battles. Face the trials without pause and rise to the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing bosses allows you to craft new equipment. With enhanced strength, take the fate of Kemet into your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.poster.avif?t=1729673795\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.webm?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994090/extras/3971c4afa5766271d104e00b77643f13.mp4?t=1729673795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Good luck.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
